      "name": "menuUpdate",
      "description": "Updates a [`Menu`](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/Menu) for display on the storefront. Modifies the menu's title and navigation structure, including nested [`MenuItem`](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/MenuItem) objects. You can update the handle for non-default menus.\n\nThe items argument accepts a list of menu items with their nested structure. Each item can include nested items to create multi-level navigation hierarchies. Default menus have restricted updates—you can't change their handles.",
